@@ -2,6 +2,22 @@
 
 Release notes are listed newest first. English is followed by Simplified Chinese.
 Test releases are experimental and do not establish real-vehicle compatibility.
+
+## [v0.1.22-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R35 — experimental projected shell; not receiver/GPU validated.
+
+### English
+- Interactive projected dashboard, home, navigation feed, music and local clock/date widgets; shared page and touch geometry.
+- Local-time light/dark palette, translucent wallpaper cards and a short GPU brightness transition; not optical refraction.
+- Independent local UI refresh while a previously established source is idle, with an idle indicator and screen ownership gate.
+- Target the rendered Android media session only, without forwarding card actions to another player.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 新增车机仪表盘、主页、导航源画面、音乐及本地时钟日历组件，统一触控布局。
+- 本地时段昼夜主题、半透明卡片及短暂 GPU 亮度过渡，非真实折射。
+- 已出画后源视频静止仍可更新本地界面，显示未更新状态并保留主屏仲裁。
+- 媒体卡片仅操作对应 Android 媒体会话，不跨播放器回退。
 
